{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1428799920309430", "organization": {"id": "1399881579867931", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1428799920309430"}]}, "id": "1165197599180990"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1428799920309430", "release_date": 1793908080, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1464107596778662"}, "id": "1130804629498881"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1428799920309430", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1464107596778662"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "1464107596778662", "version": "2.0.7", "version_code": 181, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1792490263, "id": "1428799933642762", "is_initial_release": true, "name_with_fallback": "v1", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1447544378434984"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1428799920309430"}, "id": "1447544378434984", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": true, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1428799920309430", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "2144898113568831"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1818091489318567", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Waseej", "keywords": ["Hac", "Kabe", "Hicret", "Umre", "Tarih"], "long_description": "Waseej, Ana Al Madinah VR'\u0131n sinematik belgesellerini bir araya getirir: \u0130slam miras\u0131n\u0131 konu alan, 8K \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcrl\u00fckte \u00e7ekilmi\u015f ve sanal ger\u00e7eklik i\u00e7in haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015f s\u00fcr\u00fckleyici filmler.\n\n\u015eU AN G\u00d6STER\u0130MDE\n- Hac serisi \u2014 hacc\u0131n \u00fc\u00e7 eda \u015feklinin her birini ba\u015ftan sona takip edin:\n \u2013 Temettu hacc\u0131 (Mutamatti')\n \u2013 K\u0131ran hacc\u0131 (Qarin)\n \u2013 \u0130frad hacc\u0131 (Mufrid)\n\nYAKINDA\n- K\u00e2be'nin Hik\u00e2yesi\n- Hicret\u00fc'r-Res\u00fbl \u2014 Peygamber Efendimiz'in (s.a.v.) Medine'ye hicreti\n\n\u0130ZLEME NASIL \u0130\u015eLER\nWaseej puan sistemiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: 1 puan = 1 izleme. Diledi\u011finiz filmi istedi\u011finiz kadar tekrar izleyebilirsiniz; her oynatma bir puan kullan\u0131r.\n\nK\u0130MLER \u0130\u00c7\u0130N\n- Hacca haz\u0131rlanan ve menasiki yerine getirmeden \u00f6nce g\u00f6rmek isteyen hac\u0131 adaylar\u0131\n- Aileler, \u00f6\u011frenciler ve \u00f6\u011fretmenler\n- Kutsal mek\u00e2nlar\u0131 ziyaret etmeyi \u00f6zleyen herkes\n\nOturarak rahat\u00e7a izlenebilen konforlu bir deneyim.\n\nMedine'de Ana Al Madinah VR taraf\u0131ndan \u00fcretilmi\u015ftir.", "short_description": "Tarihin ya\u015fand\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerde durun. Waseej, Ana Al Madinah VR'\u0131n 8K \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcrl\u00fckte \u00e7ekti\u011fi sinematik sanal ger\u00e7eklik belgeselleriyle \u0130slam miras\u0131n\u0131 hayata ge\u00e7iriyor. Hacc\u0131n her bir eda \u015feklini ad\u0131m ad\u0131m ya\u015fay\u0131n ve \u0130slam tarihine y\u00f6n veren mek\u00e2nlar\u0131 ke\u015ffedin \u2014 nerede olursan\u0131z olun."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_square.png", "id": "28020556477618643", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_28020556494285308_5758170467907789386_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0N6Mu3sREqUQ7kNvwHxcGJu&_nc_oc=AdqXfmQUDfodVOfBdr3OYvz1G4j56SksVx9U_plUkxplVlKo9G3KO7Yh0v92XPmOD8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRK0FLwF0cFkwiNuDXJ-zddMzh7GjyWm8cZxFZ9CYzd3Q&oe=6AF9CB6A"}, {"file_name": "icon_512.png", "id": "3139846256220344", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604375581_3139846259553677_5246569326787684833_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m69Gp4RHApIQ7kNvwHv7uFS&_nc_oc=Adrg1ZuFhpVYusAKz3XSGt13m2oZmNIIicg-CXahE3S0dVute91n_Ued9jxeO6A46WQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaz2s4r212oRk-AI6d-k7dyn46RwDY9efP5pvgNpH_Uw&oe=6AF9BDF3"}, {"file_name": "cover_hero.png", "id": "2415095192352118", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654944867_2415095195685451_2495097753284143895_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pwmF2NaMw14Q7kNvwGJQm8f&_nc_oc=AdrjXRl_3S_e-Em_Ln2wBQONioYf41w4pRANOvhCza4lA2f398_rFw_yx2fFUM-PQm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdEe15163zv-8Qm6lEpgmsTbP2KUvTP1GTVFWywGgK4g&oe=6AF9C799"}, {"file_name": "cover_landscape.png", "id": "2108550689867291", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_2108550693200624_455028845235120551_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_Dyhwn2hfgQ7kNvwHD5Jyp&_nc_oc=Ado_wqLimFOtAUY_4w_c-uJzb8hFYEAIqdFNQPzz9JMWWWs_Nbr4Oey2M5AGvNsSG3w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRirbntmfNQLcVRJZbuiXZd3PVXlUgLMaV-Lk3FSEfBeg&oe=6AF9B87F"}, {"file_name": "cover_portrait.png", "id": "2107983089817633", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654975915_2107983096